  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.05 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Assessing Certification Advisory Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.05 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Assessing Certification Advisory Board. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.5, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the executive director with the assessing certification advisory board under RSA 310-C:\n\nTable 1002.5 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Assessing Certification Advisory Board\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nCertified measurer and lister, application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $165\n\nCertified assessor assistant, application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $165\n\nCertified assessor, application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $165\n\nCertified assessor supervisor, application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $165\n\nSource. #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
